  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 11 × 7 – 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers :\n\nOption 1) − and ×\n\n11 × 7 – 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106 ⇒ 11 – 7 × 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106\n\n⇒ 11 – 7 × 48 + __**6 ÷ 37**__ = 106\n\n⇒ 11 – __**7 **____**×**____** 48**__ + 0.16 = 106\n\n⇒ __**11 + 0.16**__ – 336 = 106\n\n⇒ __**11.16 – 336**__ = 106\n\n⇒ -324.84 ≠ 106 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and +\n\n11 × 7 – 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106 ⇒ 11 × 7 – 48 ÷ 6 + 37 = 106\n\n⇒ 11 × 7 – __**48 **____**÷**____** 6**__ + 37 = 106\n\n⇒ __**11 × 7**__ – 8 + 37 = 106\n\n⇒ __**77 + 37**__ – 8 = 106\n\n⇒ __**114 – 8**__ = 106\n\n⇒**106 = 106 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\n11 × 7 – 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106 ⇒ 11 + 7 – 48 × 6 ÷ 37 = 106\n\n⇒ 11 + 7 – 48 × __**6 ÷ 37**__ = 106\n\n⇒ 11 + 7 – __**48 **____**×**____** 0.16**__ = 106\n\n⇒ __**11 + 7**__ – 7.68 = 106\n\n⇒ __**18 – 7.68**__ = 106\n\n⇒ 10.32 ≠ 106 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) – and +\n\n11 × 7 – 48 + 6 ÷ 37 = 106 ⇒ 11 × 7 + 48 – 6 ÷ 37 = 106\n\n⇒ 11 × 7 + 48 – __**6 ÷ 37**__ = 106\n\n⇒ __**11 × 7**__ + 48 – 0.16 = 106\n\n⇒ __**77 + 48**__ – 0.16 = 106\n\n⇒ __**125 –**____** 0.16**__ = 106\n\n⇒ 124.84 ≠ 106 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
